  "description": "Amateur loan shark Geon arrives to collect a debt, only to find a clueless girl. To ensure his boss gets paid, Geon is ordered to keep the ditzy accountant, Gyeong-i, by his side until her deadbeat employer resurfaces. It was supposed to be a simple stakeout, but Gyeong-i’s constant clumsiness keeps pushing the two of them into close quarters. One accidental fall, and Geon finds his hands tangled in her silky, shiny legs. Geon may never collect the cash, but he’s certainly about to get something else.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
